<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Ezr</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha Ezra</para>
  <para style="mt1">EZRA</para>
  <para style="imt1">ICHILONGOLE</para>
  <para style="ip">Ipfitabu pfa Ezra na Nehemia pfotulongela apfila Waisiraeli pfawalekelelighwe woye kuna isi yawo ya Isiraeli kulawa kuna tsiisi tsa utumwa tsa Uajemi na Babeli. Ezra kandika ichitabu chake yatulanguse apfila pfayatsengile ing'anda ya Imulungu ako Yerusalemu. Wasomi wengi wotoghola ka Ezra yeye iyandike na kupfika hamwe ichitabu cha mwanduso na cha keli cha Ighalawile Mmatsuwa, na ichitabu chenyegho cha Ezra, na cha Nehemia. Ka si Ezra baye iyandike ipfitabu apfo, yolangusa kuna imunu yungi kapfandika ipfitabu apfo pfose. Ichitabu cha Ezra chakoneka chandikighwa mna ghumwaka ghwa 440 KK. Lekeni hanu hangi mna ichitabu acho chakoneka chandikighwa mna matsuwa ghangi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu cha Ezra cholangusa Imulungu pfayamtendile mfalume Koreshi wa Uajemi yawalekelele Waisiraeli woye kuna isi yawo wakaitsenge ing'anda ya Imulungu. Alino pfipfila tsalitimitsa unabii wa Yeremia iyalongile mna ichitabu chake cha Yeremia isura ya ishilini na tisa ghumstali ghwa kumi mbaka kumi na nne. Tsahana maaduwi iwapingile ukutsengighwa kwa ing'anda ya Imulungu na isang'ano ayo itendighwa ime chidogho, lekeni hata apfo Waisiraeli, kwa ukwapfilighwa na Imulungu, wadaha ukuitsenga keli ing'anda ya Imulungu. Kwa ulungotsi wa Ezra pfipfila Waisiraeli watsileka tsinzambi tsawo na wamuyila Imulungu. Alino liwa mwanduso ghwa ukulamla kwawo ukughawinza ghamalaghitso gha Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mghati mwa ichitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya kwanza mbaka ya keli tsolangusa mfalume Koreshi pfayawalekelele Waisiraeli woye kuna isi yawo, na tsolangusa tsikaye tsihi itsibwelile.</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya kadatu mbaka ya sita tsolangusa ing'anda ya Imulungu pfaitsengighwe Yerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya saba na ya nane tsolangusa Ezra pfayoile Yerusalemu hamwe na tsikaye tsingi tsa Isiraeli.</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya tisa na kumi tsolangusa Ezra pfayawalongotse Waisiraeli woyile lilaghano lyawo lyawekile na Imulungu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Koreshi kowalaghitsa Wayahudi woye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa mwanduso hayatawale Koreshi mfalume wa Uajemu, ili imbuli ya IMNDEWA iyalongile kubitila nabii Yeremia itimile. IMNDEWA kamtenda Koreshi mfalume wa Uajemi yalapfe laghitso alino kwa ukukemelela mna ufalume wake, na pfipfila lilaghitso alyo lilapfighwa kwa ukwandikighwa. <verse eid="EZR 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2" />“Apfino pfipfo pfayolonga Koreshi mfalume wa Uajemi: IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa kulanga kangaya falume tsose tsili muisi na kanilaghitsa nimtsengele ing'anda ako Yerusalemu mna isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="EZR 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3" />Lelo chila munu mna mwemwe wose imli iwanu wake, Imulungu wake yakale hamwe naye, na yagheluke yaghende Yerusalemu ako Yuda, yakaitsenge ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, yeye yuyo Imulungu iyali ako Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4" />Chila munu iyasighale mgima, akula kokose kwayokala, iwanu iwokala habehi naye wamwapfile kwa kumwing'a fetsa, nzahabu, tsimali na wanyama, pfipfila wamwing'e ipfinu pfayolapfa imunu kwa ukubama imwenyegho pfikawe nambiko kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu ako Yerusalemu.”<verse eid="EZR 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5" />Apfo woka iwakulu wa tsikolo tsa ghamakabila gha Yuda na Benjamini, na iwatambika, na Walawi, na chila munu iyeng'ighwe ghumoyo na Imulungu kughenda kutsenga ing'anda ya IMNDEWA ili ako Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6" />Na iwanu wose iwakalile habehi nawo wawapfila kwa kuweng'a pfinu pfa fetsa, nzahabu, tsimali, wanyama na pfinu pfingi pfa bei ng'ulu, pfipfila waweng'a ipfinu pfayolapfa imunu kwa ukubama imwenyegho pfiwe nambiko ya ing'anda ya Imulungu.<verse eid="EZR 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7" />Pfipfila mfalume Koreshi kapfilapfa kunze ipfinu apfila pfa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, ipfisolighwe na mfalume Nebukadineza kulawa Yerusalemu na kupfika mna ing'anda ya imilungu yake. <verse eid="EZR 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:8" />Mfalume Koreshi wa Uajemi kamwing'a Mitiredati ipfinu apfo, mtunza ihatsina naye tsakapfipeta na kamwing'a Sheshibaza, imkulu wa Yuda. <verse eid="EZR 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9" />Apfino pfipfo ipfinu ipfipetighwe: Masinia selasini tsa nzahabu, bakuli elufu imwe tsa fetsa, pfetetso pfa shaba ishirini na tisa, <verse eid="EZR 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10" />bakuli ndodo tsa nzahabu salasini, na bakuli ndodo tsa fetsa miya nne na kumi, na pfinu pfingi elufu imwe. <verse eid="EZR 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11" />Ipfinu pfose pfa nzahabu na fetsa hamwe na pfinu pfimwenga pfose tsa elufu tano na miya nne. Pfose apfino Sheshibaza tsakapfisola na koya napfo Yerusalemu mna matsuwa aghala yeye na iwanu wangi hawoyile Yerusalemu kulawa Babeli, isi ya mhamo.<verse eid="EZR 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2" />
  <para style="s">Iwanu iwoyile kuna isi ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1" />Awano wawo iwanu wa isi ya Yuda iwoyile kulawa Babeli, isi ya mhamo. Nebukadneza mfalume wa Babeli tsakawaghogha na kawaghala ako Babeli. Chila yumwe koya kuna ghumji ghwake. <verse eid="EZR 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2" />Woya na pfilongotsi wawo awano: Zerubabeli, Yoshua, Nehemia, Seraya, Reelaya, Moridekai, Bilishani, Misipari, Bigwai, Rehumu, na Baana. Awano wawo iwanu wa tsikolo tsa Israeli iwoyile kulawa kuna isi ya utumwa. <verse eid="EZR 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Paroshi iwoyile tsa elufu mbili miya imwe sabini na weli. <verse eid="EZR 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Shefatia tsa miya ndatu sabini na weli. <verse eid="EZR 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Ara tsa miya saba sabini na watano. <verse eid="EZR 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Pahati Moabu, awala wa ulukolo lwa Yeshua na Yoabu tsa elufu mbili miya nane na kumi na weli. <verse eid="EZR 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Elamu tsa elufu imwe miya mbili hamsini na wane. <verse eid="EZR 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Zatu tsa miya tisa alubaini na watano. <verse eid="EZR 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Zakai tsa miya saba na sitini. <verse eid="EZR 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Bani tsa miya sita alubaini na weli. <verse eid="EZR 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Bebai tsa miya sita ishirini na wadatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Azigadi tsa elufu imwe miya mbili ishirini na weli. <verse eid="EZR 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Adonikamu tsa miya sita sitini na sita. <verse eid="EZR 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Bigwai tsa elufu mbili na hamsini na sita. <verse eid="EZR 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Adini tsa miya nne hamsini na wane. <verse eid="EZR 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Ateri, pfipfila iyakemighwe Hezekia, tsa tisini na wanane. <verse eid="EZR 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Besai tsa miya ndatu ishirini na wadatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Yora tsa miya imwe na kumi na weli. <verse eid="EZR 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Hashumu tsa miya mbili ishirini na wadatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20" />Iwanu wa ilukolo lwa Gibari tsa tisini na watano.<verse eid="EZR 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21" />Awani wawo iwanu wa imiji iwoyile, Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Betilehemu tsa miya imwe ishirini na wadatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22" />Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Netofa tsa hamsini na sita. <verse eid="EZR 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23" />Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Anatoti tsa miya imwe ishirini na wanane. <verse eid="EZR 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24" />Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Azimaweti tsa alubaini na weli. <verse eid="EZR 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25" />Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Kiriati Yearimu, na Kefira, na Beeroti tsa miya saba alubaini na wadatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26" />Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Rama na Geba tsa miya sita ishirini na yumwe. <verse eid="EZR 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27" />Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Mikimashi tsa miya imwe ishirini na weli. <verse eid="EZR 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28" />Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Beteli na Ai, tsa miya mbili ishirini na wadatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29" />Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Nebo tsa hamsini na weli. <verse eid="EZR 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30" />Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Magibishi tsa miya imwe hamsini na sita. <verse eid="EZR 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31" />Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa keli ghwa Elamu tsa elufu imwe miya mbili hamsini na wane. <verse eid="EZR 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32" />Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Harimu tsa miya ndatu na ishirini. <verse eid="EZR 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33" />Iwanu wa Lodi, na Hadidi, na Ono, tsa miya saba ishirini na watano. <verse eid="EZR 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34" />Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Yeriko, tsa miya ndatu alubaini na watano. <verse eid="EZR 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35" />Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Senaa, tsa elufu ndatu miya sita na selasini.<verse eid="EZR 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36" />Awano wawo iwatambika iwoyile kulawa kuna isi ya mhamo, Watambika wa lukolo lwa Yedaya, wa ikaye ya Yeshua tsa miya tisa sabini na wadatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37" />Watambika wa ilukolo lwa Imeri tsa elufu imwe hamsini na weli. <verse eid="EZR 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38" />Watambika wa ilukolo lwa Pashuri tsa elufu imwe miya mbili alubaini na saba. <verse eid="EZR 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39" />Watambika wa ilukolo lwa Harimu tsa elufu imwe na kumi na saba.<verse eid="EZR 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40" />Walawi iwoyile kulawa kuna isi ya mhamo, wa ilukolo lwa Yeshua na Kadimieli, iwana wa Hodavia tsa sabini na wane. <verse eid="EZR 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41" />Iwanu iwang'ali wakwimba iwoyile, wa ilukolo lwa Asafu tsa miya imwe na ishirini na wanane. <verse eid="EZR 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42" />Iwakalitsi iwoyile wa ilukolo lwa Shalumu, lwa Ateri, lwa Talimoni, lwa Akubu, lwa Hatita, na lwa Shobai, wose wose tsa miya imwe na selasini na tisa. <verse eid="EZR 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43" />Tsikolo tsa iwanu iwang'ali wosang'ana mna ing'anda ya Imulungu itsuyile tsitso atsino: lukolo lwa Siha, lukolo lwa Hasufa, lukolo lwa Tabaoti, <verse eid="EZR 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44" />lukolo lwa Kerosi, lukolo lwa Siaha, lukolo lwa Padoni, <verse eid="EZR 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45" />lukolo lwa Lebana, lukolo lwa Hagaba, lukolo lwa Akubu, <verse eid="EZR 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46" />lukolo lwa Hagabu, lukolo lwa Shamlai, lukolo lwa Hanani, <verse eid="EZR 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47" />lukolo lwa Gideli, lukolo lwa Gahari, lukolo lwa Reaya, <verse eid="EZR 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48" />lukolo lwa Resini, lukolo lwa Nekoda, lukolo lwa Gazamu, <verse eid="EZR 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49" />lukolo lwa Uza, lukolo lwa Pasea, lukolo lwa Besai, <verse eid="EZR 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50" />lukolo lwa Asina, lukolo lwa Meunimu, lukolo lwa Nefusimu, <verse eid="EZR 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51" />lukolo lwa Bakibuki, lukolo lwa Hakufa, lukolo lwa Harihuri, <verse eid="EZR 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52" />lukolo lwa Baziluti, lukolo lwa Mehida, lukolo lwa Harisha, <verse eid="EZR 2:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53" />lukolo lwa Barikosi, lukolo lwa Sisera, lukolo lwa Tema, <verse eid="EZR 2:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54" />lukolo lwa Nezia, na lukolo lwa Hatifa.<verse eid="EZR 2:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55" />Atsino tsitso tsikolo tsa iwanu iwang'ali womsang'anila Selemani ghumwande, iwoyile kulawa akula Babeli kuna isi ya mhamo: lukolo lwa Sotai, lukolo lwa Hasofereti, lukolo lwa Peruda, <verse eid="EZR 2:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56" />lukolo lwa Yaala, lukolo lwa Darikoni, lukolo lwa Gideli, <verse eid="EZR 2:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57" />lukolo lwa Shefatia, lukolo lwa Hatili, lukolo lwa Pokereti Hasebaimu, na lukolo lwa Ami. <verse eid="EZR 2:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58" />Iwanu wose iwang'ali wosang'ana mna ing'anda ya Imulungu hamwe na iwatumighwa wa Selemani, wose wose tsa miya ndatu tisini na weli. <verse eid="EZR 2:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59" />Iwanu wa imiji aino pfipfila tsawoya: Teli Mela, Teli Harisha, Kerubu, Adani, na Imeri. Lekeni ng'awadahile baye ukulangusa ka iwahenga wawo wolawa mna tsikolo tsa Waisiraeli. <verse eid="EZR 2:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:60" />Wawo tsawalawa mna tsikolo tsa Delaya, Tobia na Nekoda. Wose tsa wanu miya sita hamsini na weli. <verse eid="EZR 2:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61" />Iwanu wa tsikolo atsino tsa iwatambika pfipfila tsawoya, lukoo lwa Habaya, lukolo lwa Hakosi na lukolo lwa Barizilai. Barizilai ayo tsakamkwela neghe Barizilai wa Gileadi, pfipfila naye tsakakemighwa Barizilai. <verse eid="EZR 2:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62" />Awo tsawabama mataghwa ghawo mna tsikumbukumbu tsa tsikolo lekeni ng'awaghonile baye. Apfo ng'awatolighwe baye wawe watambika kwaapfila woneka ng'awelile baye. <verse eid="EZR 2:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63" />Imkulu wa isi kawalongela waleke ukuja ichijo ichilapfighwe kwa Imulungu mbaka yawe baho mtambika iyolamla kwa ghamabwe gha Urimu na Thumimu. <verse eid="EZR 2:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64" />Iwanu wose iwoyile kulawa kuna isi ya mhamo ya Babeli wose wose tsa elufu alubaini na weli miya ndatu na sitini. <verse eid="EZR 2:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65" />Pfipfila tsahana watumighwa, wamale na wapinga elufu saba, miya ndatu selasini na saba, na iwanu iwakwimba wamale na wapinga miya mbili. <verse eid="EZR 2:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66" />Woya na falasi miya saba na salasini na sita, na chihongwe falasi miya mbili na alubaini na watano. <verse eid="EZR 2:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67" />Ngamiya miya nne selasini na watano na pfihongwe elufu sita miya saba na ishilini. <verse eid="EZR 2:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68" />Hawapfikile hana ing'anda ya IMNDEWA ako Yerusalemu, pfilongotsi wamwenga wa tsikolo atso tsawalapfa tsimali kwa ukubama iwenyegho ili wapfile kuitsenge ing'anda ya Imulungu ahala haikalile ghumwande. <verse eid="EZR 2:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69" />Chila munu kalapfa ka pfayadahile kuna ihatsina kwa isang'ano aino. Ipfinu pfose pfawalapfile tsa nzahabu kilo miya tano, fetsa kilo elufu mbili na miya nane, na maghwanda gha iwatambika miya imwe. <verse eid="EZR 2:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70" />Lelo watambika, Walawi na iwanu wangi wandusa ukukala mna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu na mna ipfijji pfake. Na iwanu iwakwimba, iwokalitsa ing'anda ya Imulungu na iwang'ali wosang'ana mna ing'anda ya Imulungu wandusa ukukala mna imiji yawo, nawo Waisiraeli wose wakala mna imiji yawo.<verse eid="EZR 2:70" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3" />
  <para style="s">Imatsabahu yotsengighwa keli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1" />Haghupfikile ghumwetsi ghwa saba, iwanu wa Isiraeli hawakalile mna imiji yawo, watsa kwitingana hamwe ako Yerusalemu na wawa chinu chimwe. <verse eid="EZR 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2" />Yeshua imwana wa Yosadaki hamwe na ndughu tsake iwatambika, na Zerubabeli, imwana wa Shealitieli hamwe na ndughu tsake watsenga keli imatsabahu ya Imulungu wa Isiraeli ya ukumlapfila nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa ka pfayandikighwe mna ghamaghitso gha Musa imunu wa Imulungu. <verse eid="EZR 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3" />Hata ka tsawawapfuka iwanu iwang'ali wokala mna isi tsili habehi, watsenga imatsabahu bahala haikalile imatsabahu ya ghumwande. Kuya wang'ali womlapfila Imulungu nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa mchanya hake chila nemitondo na nemihe. <verse eid="EZR 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4" />Watenda ichihungo cha ipfibanda na walapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa itsibamighwa mna chila litsuwa, ka pfayandikighwe mna ghamalaghitso. <verse eid="EZR 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5" />Pfipfila walapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa tsa chila tsuwa, na nambiko itsilapfighwa mna ichihungo cha mlawo ghwa ghumwetsi, na mna ipfihungo pfingi pfayalaghitse IMNDEWA. Pfipfila chila munu kamlapfila nambiko IMNDEWA kwa ukubama imwenyegho. <verse eid="EZR 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6" />Hata ka ghumsingi ghwa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA tsang'ana ghutsengighwe baye, iwanu wandusa ukulapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa kwa IMNDEWA kulawa litsuwa lya mwanduso lya ghumwetsi ghwa saba.<verse eid="EZR 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ing'anda ya Imulungu yakwanza ukutsengighwa keli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7" />Kuya iwanu walapfa fetsa tsa ukuwaliha na iwanu iwotsenga na wasongola mibiki, pfipfila waweng'a ichijo, chokunwa na ghamapfuta iwanu wa imiji ya Tiro na sidoni, nawo watwing'a imibiki ya mikataluba kulawa Lebanoni. Imibiki ayo tsaighalighwa kubitila mna ibahali mbaka Yopa. Agha ghose tsaghatendighwa kwa kwapfilighwa na mfalume Koreshi wa Uajemi. <verse eid="EZR 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8" />Apfo iwanu wandusa kusang'ana mna ghumwetsi ghwa keli ghwa ghumwaka ghwa keli ahala hawaipfikile kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu kuna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu. Zerubabeli mwana wa Shealitieli, Yeshua mwana wa Yosadaki, wandughu tsawo wangi, Watambika, Walawi na iwanu wangi iwoyile Yerusalemu kulawa akula kwawaamile tsawelunga nawo mna isang'ano ayo. Walawi wose iwana imiyaka ishirini na kughendelela wasaghulighwa wemilile isang'ano ya ukutsenga ghoya keli ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="EZR 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9" />Yeshua, na iwanaghe wamale na ndughu tsake hamwe na Kadimieli na iwanaghe, iwalawile mna lukolo lwa Hodavia, wose tsawawemilila iwanu iwang'ali wotsenga ing'anda ya Imulungu. Pfipfila wapfilighwa na iwana na iwatsukulu wa Henadadi, na ndughu tsawo Walawi. <verse eid="EZR 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10" />Iwanu iwotsenga hawanduse ukwika ghumsingi ghwa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, iwatambika aku wapfala maghwanda ghawo, wema hanu aho aku wakinda malati mna ghamoko, nawo walawi wa lukolo lwa Asafu wema na matoazi ghawo, wamtunya IMNDEWA ka pfawalaghitsighwe na mfalume Daudi wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="EZR 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11" />Wemba kwa ukwibokelela, wamtunya Imulungu, wemba apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 3:11">“Kwaapfila yeye kanogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 3:11">ukukunda kwake kwa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 3:11">kwokala matsuwa ghose.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 3:11">Iwanu wose wamtunya Imulungu kwa litsi kulu kwaapfila ghumsingi ghwa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA ghwandusa ukutsengighwa. <verse eid="EZR 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12" />Lekeni watambika wamwenga, Walawi na pfilongotsi wa kolo iwakalile wanzehe na iwayonile ing'anda ya mwanduso, wang'ali wolila kwa kukemelela hawonile ghumsingi ghungi ghwa ing'anda ya Imulungu ghwakwikighwa, aku iwanu wangi wang'ali wokemelela kwa ukudeng'elela. <verse eid="EZR 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13" />Iwanu ng'awadahile baye ukutanga litsi lya ukudeng'elela na litsi lya chililo kwaapfila tsatsihulikika ka tsogho na tsatsihulika kutali sideke.<verse eid="EZR 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4" />
  <para style="s">Wayahudi woghomighwa waleke ukutsenga keli Ing'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1" />Maaduwi wa wanu wa Yuda na Benjamini hawahulike ka iwanu iwoyile kulawa kuna isi ya Babeli woitsenga keli ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, <verse eid="EZR 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2" />wamghendela Zerubabeli na pfilongotsi wa tsikolo na wamlongela, “Leka tumwapfileni ukutsenga ing'anda ya Imulungu. Kwa apfila hata twetwe twombama Imulungu wenu ka mwemwe na tung'ali tumlapfila nambiko kulawa mna ghamatsuwa gha Esari Hadoni, mfalume wa Ashuru iyatughalile ahano.”<verse eid="EZR 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3" />Lekeni Zerubabeli, Yeshua na pfilongotsi wangi wa kolo tsa Isiraeli wawalongela, “Twetwe ng'atubama baye mwemwe mtwapfile ukutsenga ing'anda ya Imulungu wetu. Twetwe tuwenyegho tutsomtsengela IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli ka mfalume Koreshi wa Uajemi pfayatulaghitse.”<verse eid="EZR 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4" />Baho iwanu iwang'ali wokala hanu aho tsawabama kuwatenyula imimoyo na kuwatenda Wayahudi wapfuke, waleke kughendelela ukutsenga. <verse eid="EZR 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5" />Pfipfila tsawawahonga pfilongotsi wa isi ya Uajemi wapfulughe achila chawang'ali wobama ukutenda Wayahudi. Tsawatenda apfo mna ghamatsuwa ghose ghayatawale Koreshi mfalume wa Uajemi mbaka mna ghamatsuwa ghayatawale Dario, mfalume wa Uajemi.<verse eid="EZR 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutsengighwa keli Yerusalemu koghomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6" />Mfalume Ahasuero hayanduse ukutawala, iwanu awo tsawawandikila ghamaghomba iwanu iwang'ali wokala Yuda na Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7" />Kuya hayatawale Aritashasta mfalume wa Uajemi, Bishilamu, Mitiredati, Tabeeli na wayaghe wamwandikila baluwa mfalume Aritashasta. Ibaruwa ayo yandikighwa kwa ghumwandiko ghwa chiaramu na lugha ya chiaramu. <verse eid="EZR 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8" />Pfipfila Rehumu, mkulu wa maasikali, na Shimshai, imwandishi tsawamwandikila Abashasta ibaruwa iilonga Yerusalemu Apfino. <verse eid="EZR 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9" />“Kulawa kuna nene Rehumu, mkulu wa maasikali, na Shimshai, imwandishi wa isi, hamwe na wayetu, walamlitsi na pfilongotsi wose iwolawa ghumji ghwa Ereki, ghwa Babeli na ghwa Susa mna isi ya Elamu, <verse eid="EZR 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10" />hamwe na iwanu wa isi tsingi iwasolighwe na Asuri Banipali, imunu mkulu na yana ingupfu, na kawalosa kaweka wakale mna ghumji ghwa Samaria na hanu hangi mna isi ya magharibi ya ghumto Eufurati.”<verse eid="EZR 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11" />Ibaruwa yenyegho ilonga apfino: “Kwa mfalume Aritashasta: Twetwe iwatumighwa wako wa isi ya magharibi ya Eufrati twokulamsa. <verse eid="EZR 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12" />Twobama ghweghwe umanye ghendo ka Wayahudi iwagheluke kutsa kuna twetwe, awala iwalawile kuna ghweghwe, waghenda Yerusalemu na woghutsenga keli ghumji ghuna iwanu wehile na iwolema kuhulikitsa. Womalitsila ukutsenga ubanda wake na ukutsenga ghumsingi. <verse eid="EZR 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13" />Ghwe mfalume, twobama umanye ka ghumji aghuno ghung'atsengighwa keli na ubanda wake ung'amala iwanu watsoleka ukuliha ikodi, ushulu, wala ada, na ihatsina yako itsohunguka. <verse eid="EZR 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14" />Lelo, kwaapfila twetwe twokuhulikitsa ghweghwe, ng'atubama baye twone apfila ghweghwe mfalume wetu pfautsoumbuka, apfo twona pfinogha tukulongele. <verse eid="EZR 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15" />Ibamighwe mna ichitabu cha tsikumbukumbu tsa sekulu tsako, amwo itsakwoneka ka kulawa ghumwande iwanu wa ghumji aghuno tsa weha na wang'ali wowatsupfa wafalume na iwakulu wa isi. Aghano ghaghutenda ghumji aghuno ghuhinyighwe. <verse eid="EZR 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16" />Twobama ghweghwe mfalume umanye ghendo ka ghumji aghuno ghung'atsengighwa keli na ubanda wake ung'amala ng'utsodaha baye kuitawala isi ya magharibi ya Eufurati.” <verse eid="EZR 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17" />Kuya mfalume kawedika apfino, “Kwa Rehumu, mkulu wa maasikali, na Shimshai, imwandishi wa isi, na wayenu wose iwokala Samaria na iwokala kungi mna isi ya magharibi ya Eufurati: <verse eid="EZR 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18" />Ibaluwa yamnitumile itafasilighwa na isomighwa hambele hangu. <verse eid="EZR 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19" />Tsanilaghitsa iwanu wabame bame mna tsikumbukumbu, na itangika ghendo ka kulawa ghumwande ghumji aghuno ghung'ali ghuwatendela tsengwe iwafalume wake na ghumema iwanu wehile na iwaghobo. <verse eid="EZR 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20" />Wafalume wana tsingupfu tsawatawala ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu na isi ya maghalibi ya Eufurati aku wang'ali wobokela ikodi, ushuru na ada. <verse eid="EZR 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21" />Lelo walaghitseni iwanu awo waleke ukutsenga keli ghumji agho mbaka hanitsolaghitsa keli. <verse eid="EZR 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22" />Kuya mwalangitse mleke kukawa ukutenda apfo. Heule ichinu achino ichighuma wogha chighendelele, na kunitenda nene mfalume nibunzike?”<verse eid="EZR 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23" />Hawamalitse ukuisoma ibaluwa aino kulawa kwa Aritashasta, Rehumu, Shimshai, imwandishi na wayawo wasumka waghenda Yerusalemu kuwananahitsa Wayahudi kwa ngupfu waleke ukutsenga ghumji.<verse eid="EZR 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsing'onde mna ing'anda ya Imulungu tsakwanza keli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24" />Apfo isang'ano ya ukuitsenga keli ing'anda ya Imulungu mna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu ima mbaka mna ghumwaka ghwa keli ghwayatawale Dario mfalume wa Uajemi.<verse eid="EZR 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1" />Matsuwa agho manabii weli Hagai na Zakaria mwana wa Ido wandusa kuwatabiliya Wayahudi iwang'ali wokala Yuda na Yerusalemu kwa taghwa lya Imulungu wa Isiraeli, iyakalile hamwe nawo. <verse eid="EZR 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2" />Kuya Zerubabeli, mwana wa Shealitieli, na Yeshua mwana wa Yosadaki hawahulike imbuli ayo wandusa keli ukutsenga ing'anda ya Imulungu mna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu na wapfilighwa na manabii wa Imulungu. <verse eid="EZR 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3" />Mna ghamatsuwa ghagho, Tatenai, mkulu wa isi ya magharibi ya Eufurati, Shetari Bozenai na wayawo waghenda Yerusalemu kughutsa, “Angu nani iyawalongele muitsenge ing'anda aino mbaka muimalitse?” <verse eid="EZR 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4" />Pfipfila waghutsa, “Tsina nani iwotsenga ing'anda aino? Twobama ghamataghwa ghawo.” <verse eid="EZR 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5" />Lekeni Imulungu yang'ali yowakinga iwanzehe wa Wayahudi, apfo iwakulu awo ng'awawaghomile baye mbaka hawamwandikile mfalume Dario na kutegheletsa yolonga choni. <verse eid="EZR 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6" />Apfo Tatenai mkulu wa isi ya maghambi ya Eufurati, Shetari Bozenai na wayawo wamwandikila baluwa mfalume Dario.<verse eid="EZR 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:7" />Ibaluwa yawamtumile mfalume tsayandikighwa apfino: Mfalume Dario twokulamsa.<verse eid="EZR 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8" />Ghwe mfalume twobama umanye ka tughenda kuna isi ya Yuda kwaili ing'anda ya Imulungu Mkulu. Iwanu woitsenga Ing'anda kwa mabwe makulu na ubanda wake wakwikighwa mighamba. Isang'ano ayo yotendeka kwa ngupfu na yoghendelela pfinoghile ghendo.<verse eid="EZR 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9" />Tuwaghutsa pfilongotsi watulongele nani yawalaghitse waitsenge ing'anda aino na kuumalitsa ubanda wake. <verse eid="EZR 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10" />Pfipfila tughutsa ghamataghwa gha awala iwolongotsa isang'ano aino ili tukulongele ghweghwe.<verse eid="EZR 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11" />“Wawo watwidika apfino, ‘Twetwe twa watumighwa wa Imulungu wa kulanga na wa isi, na twoitsenga keli ing'anda itsengighwe na kumalitsika miyaka mingi ifosile na mfalume mkulu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="EZR 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12" />Kwaapfila wahenga wetu wamtenda Imulungu wa kulanga yaghudubuke, apfo kawaleka waghoghighwe na mfalume Nebukadneza wa Babeli, Mkalidayo, yeye yuyo iyaihinyile ing'anda aino na kuwaghala iwanu ako Babeli. <verse eid="EZR 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13" />Lekeni mna ghumwaka ghwa mwanduso ghwayatawale mfalume Koreshi wa Babeli, yeye Koreshi kalaghitsa ing'anda aino ya Imulungu itsengighwe keli. <verse eid="EZR 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14" />Pfipfila kapfuyitsa ipfinu pfa nzahabu na pfa fetsa pfayasolile mfalume Nebukadneza kulawa kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu ili ako Yerusalemu, na kapfika mna ing'anda ya Imulungu wake ako Babeli. Koreshi kapfilapfa ipfinu apfo kuna Ing'anda ako Babeli na kamwing'a Sheshibaza iyamsimike yawe mkulu wa Yuda. <verse eid="EZR 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15" />Kamlongela, “Sola ipfinu apfino, uke napfo na ukapfike kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu ihili Yerusalemu na ukaitsenge keli ing'anda ayo ya Imulungu bahala haitsengighwe ghumwande.” <verse eid="EZR 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16" />Kuya Sheshibaza katsa, keka ghumsingi ghwa ing'anda ya Imulungu mna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, na kulawa ghamatsuwa agho mbaka sambi iwanu wang'ali woghendelela ukuitsenga, lekeni ing'anda ng'ana imale baye.’<verse eid="EZR 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17" />“Lelo mfalume, ka kwakona pfinogha walongele iwanu wabame mna tsikumbukumbu tsa chifalume mna ghumji ghwa Babeli, ka mfalume Koreshi tsakalaghitsa ing'anda aino ya Imulungu itsengighwe mna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu. Kuya twokulomba mfalume utulongele chaulamla mna imbuli alino.”<verse eid="EZR 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6" />
  <para style="s">Malaghitso gha mfalume Dario ghakoneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1" />Mfalume Dario kalaghitsa, iwanu wabamebame mna tsing'anda tsikighwe ipfitabu pfa tsikumbukumbu tsa chifalume ako Babeli. <verse eid="EZR 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2" />Na ichitabu wachipata kuna ghumji ghwa Ekibatana mna isi ya Media. Na aghano ghagho ighandikighwe mumo:<verse eid="EZR 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3" />“Mfalume Koreshi hayatawale mna ghumwaka ghwa mwanduso kalaghitsa ing'anda ya Imulungu itsengighwe keli mna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, hawe hanu ha ukulapfila nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa, chimo chake chiwe futi tisini na ughatsi wake uwe futi tisini. <verse eid="EZR 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4" />Chila hamtsenga kotsi ndatu tsa ghamabwe, mwike kotsi imwe ya mighamba mchanya mwa ghamabwe agho. Ihatsina ya mfalume itsoliha chila chinu. <verse eid="EZR 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5" />Pfipfila ipfinu pfose pfa nzahabu na fetsa pfayasolile Nebukadneza kulawa kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu ako Yerusalemu na kupfighala Babeli pfobamighwa pfuye, na chila chinu chikakale hanu hake mna ing'anda ya Imulungu.”<verse eid="EZR 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Dario kolaghitsa isang'ano ighendelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6" />Baho mfalume Dario kawaghalila usenga auno: “Kwa Tatenai mkulu wa isi ya magharibi ya Efurate, Shetari Bozenai na pfilongotsi wayagho wa isi ayo, kaleni kutali na ing'anda ayo. <verse eid="EZR 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7" />Ilekeni isang'ano aino ya ukutsenga ing'anda ya Imulungu ighendelele. Mlekeni mkulu wa isi ya Yuda na pfilongotsi wa Wayahudi waitsenge ing'anda aino ya Imulungu bahala haitsengighwe ghumwande. <verse eid="EZR 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8" />Pfipfila, nolaghitsa mwemwe mtsowapfila mna isang'ano ayo. Ihatsina ya mfalume itsowaliha iwanu iwosang'ana bila kukawa, nayo itsolawa kuna ikodi ilawa isi ya maghalibi ya ghumto ghwa Eufurat, ili ing'onde ayo ileke kwima. <verse eid="EZR 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9" />Chila tsuwa, bila kuleka, mtsoweng'a iwatambika wa Yerusalemu chila chinu chawobama, wawe wang'ombe wadowado, wang'unzu, au wang'olo wadowado wa nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa kwa Imulungu wa kulanga au ingano, mkele, idipfai au ghamapfuta gha nzeituni. <verse eid="EZR 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10" />Agha ghose tsaghatendeka ili wadahe kumlapfila Imulungu wa kulanga nambiko itsimnoghela na wanombele nene na wanangu tughendelele kukala wagima. <verse eid="EZR 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11" />Pfipfila nolaghitsa apfino, imunu wowose iyoleka kukinda lilaghitso alino, ghumbiki ighukindilisa ing'anda yake ghung'olighwe, kuswa kwake kosongolighwe, naye yatumbulighwe nagho. Kuya ing'anda yake itendighwe tsalala. <verse eid="EZR 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12" />Na Imulungu iyasaghule ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu ghuwe hanu ha ukumtambikila yeye, yamghwise hasi mfalume wowose au wanu wowose iwatsolema kulikinda lilaghitso alino, au iyobama kuihinya ing'anda aino ya Imulungu ili mna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu. Nene Dario nolaghitsa chila munu yalikinde laghitso alino.”<verse eid="EZR 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ing'anda yolapfighwa iwe ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13" />Apfo Tatenai mkulu wa isi ya magharibi ya ghumto Eufurati, na Shetari Bozenai na pfilongotsi wayao watenda kwa ngupfu tsawo tsose ka apfila ghamalaghitso gha mfalume Dario pfaghabamile. <verse eid="EZR 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14" />Pfilongotsi wa Wayahudi waghendelela pfinoghile ghendo na isang'ano ya ukuitsenga ing'anda ya Imulungu na wagumighwa ghumoyo na nabii Hagai na Zakaria mwana wa Ido. wamalitsa ukutsenga Ing'anda ka pfawalaghitsighwe na Imulungu wa Isiraeli, na ka apfila pfawalaghitsighwe na Koreshi, na Dario, na Aritashasta, wafalume wa Uajemi <verse eid="EZR 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15" />Ing'anda ayo ya Imulungu imala mna litsuwa lya kadatu lya ghumwetsi ighukemigha Adari mna ghumwaka ghwa sita ghwayatawale mfalume Dario. <verse eid="EZR 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16" />Apfo iwanu wa Isiraeli, na iwatambika, na Walawi na iwanu wangi iwoyile kulawa kuna isi ya Babeli wailapfa ing'anda iwe ya Imulungu kwa ndeng'elo ng'ulu. <verse eid="EZR 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17" />Mna ukuilapfa ing'anda ayo iwe ya Imulungu, walapfa ng'ombe wamale miya imwe, ng'unzu miya mbili, wang'olo wadoghodogho miya nne wawe nambiko, pfipfila walapfa mvulati kumi na weli wawe nambiko ya ukuwaleghusila tsinzambi Waisiraeli, chila yumwe yawe wa chila likabila lya Isiraeli. <verse eid="EZR 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18" />Pfipfila waweka iwatambika na Walawi mna isang'ano ya Imulungu ako Yerusalemu ka pfayandikighwe mna ichitabu cha Musa.<verse eid="EZR 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichihungo cha Ipasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19" />Mna litsuwa lya kumi na nne lya ghumwetsi ghwa mwanduso, iwanu iwoyile kulawa Babeli, isi ya mhamo, wadeng'ela ichihungo cha Pasaka. <verse eid="EZR 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20" />Kwaapfila iwatambika na Walawi wetenda wenyegho wele, na tsawela ghendo. Wawasubutulila wang'olo wa Pasaka iwanu wose iwoyile kulawa kuna isi ya Babeli, na watambika wayawo, na wakwao iwenyegho. <verse eid="EZR 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21" />Iwajile wananang'olo wa Pasaka tsa iwanu wose iwoyile kulawa kuna isi ya Babeli, na iwanu wangi iwatsilekile nzila tsa iwanu iwali si Waisiraeli ili wamtambikile Imulungu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="EZR 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22" />Kwa matsuwa saba tsawadeng'elela ichihungo cha pfighate ipfilihela hamila kwaapfila IMNDEWA tsakawatenda wadeng'elele ng'ani na kamtenda mfalume Ashuru yawakunde, naye kawapfila mna isang'ano ya ukutsenga ing'anda ya Imulungu wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="EZR 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7" />
  <para style="s">Ezra kopfika Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1" />Hambele, mna ghamatsuwa ghayatawale mfalume Aritashasta wa Uajemi, tsahana munu yumwe iyakemighwe Ezra, mwana wa Seraya, Seraya tsa mwana wa Azariya, Azariya tsa mwana wa Hilikiya, <verse eid="EZR 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2" />Hilikiya tsa mwana wa Shalumu, Shalumu tsa mwana wa Sadoki, Sadoki tsa mwana Ahitubu, <verse eid="EZR 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3" />Ahitubu tsa mwana wa Amariya, Amariya tsa mwana wa Azariya, Azariya tsa mwana wa Meroyoti, <verse eid="EZR 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4" />Meroyoti tsa mwana wa Zerahia, Zerahiya tsa mwana wa Uzi, Uzi tsa mwana wa Buki, <verse eid="EZR 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5" />naye Buki tsa mwana wa Abishua, Abishua tsa mwana wa Finehasi, Finehasi tsa mwana wa Eleazari, Eliazari tsa mwanawa Wa Aruni mtambika mkulu. <verse eid="EZR 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6" />Ezra katsa kulawa Babeli, ayuno tsakadaha ukufunda ghoya ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli ghayamwing'ile Musa. Mfalume tsakamwing'a Ezra chila chinu chayabamile, kwaapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu wake tsakahamwe naye. <verse eid="EZR 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa saba ghwayatawale mfalume Aritashasta, Ezra kalawa Babeli kaghenda Yerusalemu, kelongotsa na Waisiraeli wamwenga, Watambika, Walawi, wanu iwakwimba, iwokalitsa ghamalango, na iwosang'ana mna ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="EZR 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8" />Wapfika mna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu mna litsuwa lya mwanduso lya mwetsi ghwa tano mna ghumwaka ghwa saba ghwayatawale mfalume Aritashasta, <verse eid="EZR 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:9" />kwaapfila Ezra tsakanza ghumwanza ghwake mna litsuwa lya mwanduso lya ghumwetsi ghwa kwanza, naye kapfika Yerusalemu mna litsuwa lya mwanduso lya mwetsi ghwa tano, kwaapfila Imulungu wake yana uluso tsakahamwe naye. <verse eid="EZR 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10" />Ezra tsakelapfa kwa ghumoyo ghose mna ukwifunda na ukukinda ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA, na ukuwafunda iwanu wa Isiraeli wakinde imiko na ghamalaghitso ghake.<verse eid="EZR 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibaluwa iyeng'ighwe Ezra na Mfalume Aritashasta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11" />Aino iyo ibaluwa Aritashasta iyamwing'ile Ezra, iyaklalile mtambika na mwandishi, na iyamanyile sideke imiko na ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA ghayaweng'ile iwanu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="EZR 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12" />“Kulawa kwa Aritashasta mfalume wa wafalume, kwa Ezra, mtambika na mlangulitsi wa malaghitso gha Imulungu wa kulanga, nokulamsa. <verse eid="EZR 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13" />Nolaghitsa apfino mna ufalume wangu, munu wowose wa Isiraeli, au watambika wawo, au walawi, iyobama kuya Yerusalemu kwa ukubama yeye imwenyegho, nayoke hamwe na ghweghwe. <verse eid="EZR 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14" />Nene na iwanu wangu saba iwonishauli twokutuma ughende ako Yuda na Yerusalemu ukaghutse ghutse ka malaghitso gha Imulungu wako ghawing'ighwe ghokindighwa ghoya. <verse eid="EZR 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15" />Kutsosola fetsa na nzahabu yatumlapfile Imulungu wa Isiraeli iyokala Yerusalemu, aila nene na iwanu wangu iwonyapfila yatulapfile kwa ukubama tuwenyegho. <verse eid="EZR 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16" />Pfipfila kutsosola fetsa na nzahabu tsaubokele kulawa mna isi ya Babeli, na ipfinu pfose ipfilapfighwe na Waisiraeli na iwatambika kwa ukubama iwenyegho, pfiwe pfa ing'anda ya Imulungu wawo ili ako Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17" />Kwa tsisendi atso mtsoghulila wango'mbe wamale, wang'unzu, wanang'olo na nambiko ya ipfijo na dipfai na kupfilapfa kuna imatsabahu ya ing'anda ya Imulungu wenu ili Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18" />Ifetsa na inzahabu ikala, kodaha kuitumila na wayagho ka pfaubama na ka Imulungu pfayakona pfinogha. <verse eid="EZR 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19" />Umlapfile Imulungu wa Yerusalemu pfinu pfose pfawing'ighwe pfiwe pfa ing'anda ya Imulungu wako. <verse eid="EZR 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20" />Ung'abama chinu chochose cha ing'anda ya Imulungu wako kutsopata kulawa kuna ihatsina ya mfalume. <verse eid="EZR 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21" />Nene mfalume Aritashasta nowalaghitsa iwanu wose iwotunza tsihatsina tsili mna isi ya magharibi ya ghumto Eufurati, chochose chayobama Ezra imtambika na imwandishi wa ghamlaghitso gha Imulungu wa kulanga yeng'ighwe kwa moyo ghumwe, <verse eid="EZR 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22" />mbaka kilo elufu ndatu na miya nne tsa fetsa, ingano kilo elufu kumi, dipfai lita elfu mbili, ghamapfuta lita elufu mbili na ghumkele ghoghose ghayobama. <verse eid="EZR 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23" />Chila chinu chayalaghitse Imulungu wa kulanga chiwe cha ing'anda yake, chitendeke pfipfo ghendo, hela katsoughudubukila ufalume wangu na iwanangu. <verse eid="EZR 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24" />Pfipfila mmanye ghendo ka mghomighwa kuwekila ikodi, ushuru au ada iwatambika wose, walawi, iwakwimba, iwokalitsa ghamalango, wasang'ana au iwatumighwa wangi wa ing'anda aino ya Imulungu. <verse eid="EZR 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25" />Naghwe Ezra, kwa ihekima iyakwing'ile Imulungu wako, ayo yuli nayo, uwasaghule iwohigha na walamlitsi iwatsowalongotsa iwanu wose iwokala mna isi ya magharibi ya Eufurati, awala iwokala kwa kukinda ghamalaghitso gha Imulungu wako. Na ayula iyang'aghamanyile baye ghamalaghitso agho, umfunde. <verse eid="EZR 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26" />Munu wowose iyolema kukinda malaghitso gha Imulungu wako, au malaghitso gha mfalume, yahighighwe ukufa, au yalawe mna isi, au yabokighwe tsimali tsake, au yohighwe kuna ligeletsa”<verse eid="EZR 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ezra komtunya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27" />Ezra kalonga, “Yatunyighwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wetu, iyamwing'ile mfalume ghumoyo ghwa ukuihamba ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, ili ako Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28" />Kwa uluso wake Imulungu, tsanyapfilighwa na mfalume na iwanu iwomshauli, na pfilongotsi wake iwana uwetso mkulu. Nipata ngupfu mna ghumoyo ghwangu kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wangu tsakahamwe na nene, mbaka niweka hamwe pfilongotsi wa Isiraeli ili woye hamwe na nene.”<verse eid="EZR 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8" />
  <para style="s">Iwanu iwoyile na Ezra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1" />Awano wawo iwakulu wa tsikolo iwoyile na nene Ezra kulawa Babeli mna ghamatsuwa ghayatawale mfalume Aritashasta: <verse eid="EZR 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2" />Imkulu wa ilukolo lwa Finehasi tsa Gerishomu, wa ilukolo lwa Itamari tsa Danyeli, wa ilukolo lwa Daudi tsa Hatushi, imwana wa Shekaniya, <verse eid="EZR 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3" />wa ilukolo lwa Paroshi tsa Zekaria, koya hamwe na wamale miya na hamsini wa ilukolo lwake iwandikighwe hamwe. <verse eid="EZR 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4" />imkulu wa lukolo lwa Pahati Moabu tsa Eliehoenai, imwana wa Zerahia, koya hamwe na wamale miya mbili, <verse eid="EZR 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5" />wa lukolo lwa Zatu tsa Shakania imwana wa Yahazieli, koya hamwe na wamale miya ndatu, <verse eid="EZR 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6" />wa lukolo lwa Adini tsa Ebedi, imwana wa Yonasanina, koya hamwe na wamale hamsini, <verse eid="EZR 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7" />wa lukolo lwa Elamu tsa Yeshaya, imwana wa Ataliana, koya hamwe na wamale sabini, <verse eid="EZR 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8" />wa lukolo lwa Shefatia tsa Zebadia, imwana wa Mikaeli, koya hamwe na wamale semanini, <verse eid="EZR 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9" />wa lukolo lwa Yoabu tsa Obadia, imwana wa Yehieli, koya hamwe na wamale miya mbili kumi na nane, <verse eid="EZR 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10" />wa lukolo lwa Bani tsa Shelemoti, imwana wa Yosifia, koya hamwe na wamale miya imwe na sitini, <verse eid="EZR 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11" />wa lukolo lwa Bebai tsa Zekaria, imwana wa Bebai, koya hamwe na wamale ishirini na nane, <verse eid="EZR 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12" />wa lukolo lwa Azigadi tsa Yohanani, imwana wa Hakatani, koya hamwe na wamale miya imwe na kumi, <verse eid="EZR 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13" />wa lukolo lwa Adonikamu tsa Elifeleti, Yeueli, na Shemaya koya hamwe na wamale sitini, awano tsawoya hambele. <verse eid="EZR 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14" />Iwakulu wa lukolo lwa Bigwai tsa Utai na Zakuri iwoyile hamwe na wamale sabini.<verse eid="EZR 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ezra kolomba yeng'ighwe Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15" />Tsaniwatinganitsa hamwe iwanu wose hambalimbali ha ghumto ighughenda kuna ghumji ghwa Ahava. Tukala ako matsuwa madatu. Haniwakaghule iwanu na watambika, sonile baye hata Mlawi yumwe. <verse eid="EZR 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16" />Apfo niwakema pfilongotsi awano watse kuna nene: Eliezeri, Arieli, Shemaya, Elinatani, Yaribu, Elinatani, Natani, Zekaria na Meshulamu. Pfipfila niwakema walangulitsi weli, Yoyaribu na Elinatani. <verse eid="EZR 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17" />Kuya niwaghala kwa Ido, chilongotsi wa iwanu akula Kasifia, na nimlomba yeye na wayaghe, na awala iwasang'ane mna ing'anda ya Imulungu wetu, watughalile iwanu iwatsosang'ana mna Ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="EZR 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18" />Kwaapfila Imulungu wetu yana uluso tsakahamwe na twetwe, wawo watughalila Sherebia, imunu yana udaha mkulu iyolawa mna ilukolo lwa Mahili, mwanaghe Lawi na mtsukulu wa Isiraeli, yeye katsa na iwanaghe wamale na ndughu tsake, wosewose tsa kumi na nane. <verse eid="EZR 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19" />Pfipfila watughalila Hashabia na Yeshaya, iwolawa mna ilukolo lwa Merari, iwatsile na ndughu tsawo na wehwa wawo, wose wose tsa ishirini. <verse eid="EZR 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:20" />Pfipfila watughalila wanu miya mbili na ishilini iwosang'ana mna ing'anda ya Imulungu, iwanu awo sekulu tsawo tsawasaghulighwa na Daudi na pfilongotsi wake wawapfile Walawi. Mataghwa ghose gha iwanu awano tsaghandikighwa.<verse eid="EZR 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ezra kowalongotsa iwanu mna ukufunga na ukulomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21" />Kuya nilaghitsa wose tufunge baho hana ghumto Ahava, na twihulumse hambele ha Imulungu wetu na kumlomba yatukinge na yatulongotse mna ghumwanza ghwetu, hamwe na iwana wetu, na tsimali tsetu tsose. <verse eid="EZR 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22" />Tsambona chinyala ukumlomba mfalume yangaye maasikali na wakwila falasi wa ukutukinga na iwanu iwotuhila mnzila kwaapfila tsanongola kumlongela mfalume apfino, “Imulungu wetu yana uluso kahamwe na imunu wowose iyombama, lekeni kowonela maya ng'ulu awala wose iwomleka.” <verse eid="EZR 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23" />Apfo tufunga na tumlomba Imulungu yatukinge, naye kahulika aghala ghatulombile.<verse eid="EZR 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipfinu ipfilapfighwe pfiwe pfa Ing'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24" />Kuya niwasaghula wanu kumi na weli, kulawa mna ipfilongotsi wa iwatambika, Sherebia, Hashabia, hamwe na ndughu tsawo kumi. <verse eid="EZR 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25" />Awano niwapimila ifetsa, inzahabu, na ipfinu ipfilapfighwe na mfalume, walamlitsi, pfilongotsi wake, na iwanu wa Isiraeli wose iwakalile kuko, pfawalapfile pfiwe nambiko ya ing'anda ya Imulungu wetu. <verse eid="EZR 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26" />Apfino pfipfo ipfinu pfaniwapimile: fetsa tani ishilini na mbili, pfinu pfa fetsa miya imwe, utsito wake kilo sabini, nzahabu kilo elufu ndatu na miya nne, <verse eid="EZR 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27" />mabakuli ishirini gha nzahabu, utsito wake kilo nane, pfinu pfili pfa shaba inoghile, imelemeta na ina ibei ng'ulu ka nzahabu. <verse eid="EZR 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28" />Kuya niwalongela, “Mwemwe mwa wanu welile wa IMNDEWA, na ipfinu apfo napfo pfela, ifetsa na inzahabu ilapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wenu kwa ukubama wenyegho iwanu. <verse eid="EZR 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29" />Lelo mpfikalitse mbaka hamtsopfipima keli mghati mwa ipfiheto pfili mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA ako Yerusalemu, hambele ha iwakulu wa iwatambika, Walawi, na pfilongotsi wa tsikolo tsa Isiraeli.”<verse eid="EZR 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30" />Apfo iwatambika, na Walawi, wabokela na kupfilola ghoya, ifetsa, inzahabu, na ipfinu pfose pfawapimighwe, ili wapfighale Yerusalemu kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu wetu.<verse eid="EZR 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gumwanza ghwa Ukuya Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31" />Mna litsuwa lya kumi na mbili lya ghumwetsi ghwa mwanduso twanza ghumwanza kulawa kuna ghumto Ahava tughenda Yerusalemu. Imulungu wetu yana uluso tsakakala na twetwe, katukinga na iwanu iwotuhila na awala iwoboka iwanu mnzila. <verse eid="EZR 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32" />Hatupfikile Yerusalemu tubwihila kwa matsuwa madatu. <verse eid="EZR 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33" />Mna litsuwa lya kane, hatuli twamghati mwa ing'anda ya Imulungu, tuipima ifetsa aila, inzahabu na ipfinu apfila, kuya tupfika mna ghamoko gha mtambika Meremoti, imwana wa Uria. Eleazari, imwana wa Finehasi, na Walawi weli tsawakala hamwe naye, Yozabadi mwana wa Yeshua, na Noadia, imwana wa Binui. <verse eid="EZR 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34" />Chila chinu chipetighwa na chipimighwa, na chila utsito wa chila chinu wandikighwa. <verse eid="EZR 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35" />Kuya iwanu wose iwoyile kulawa kuna isi ya mhamo wamlapfila Imulungu wa Isiraeli nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa. Walapfa ng'ombe wamale kumi na mbili wawe nambiko ya Waisiraeli wose, ng'unzu tisini na sita na wanang'olo sabini na saba, mene kumi na weli wawe nambiko ya ukuleghusa tsinzambi. Wanyama wose awano tsawalapfighwa wawe nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa kwa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="EZR 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36" />Pfipfila waweng'a iwakulu iwamwapfile mfalume na pfilongotsi wa isi tsa magharibi ya ghumto ghwa Eufurati ghamalaghitso ghaweng'ighwe na mfalume, nawo tsawawapfila iwanu na ing'anda ya Imulungu.<verse eid="EZR 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9" />
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli wokwela wapinga wa isi tsingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1" />Haghatendeke agha ghose, pfilongotsi watsa kunongela, “Iwanu wa Isi ya Isiraeli, iwatambika, na Walawi, ng'awebaghule baye na iwanu wa isi tsingi iwotenda ipfinu pfa ukudesa, ka awala Wakanaani, Wahiti, Waperizi, Wayebusi, Waamoni, Wamoabi, Wamisri, na Waamori. <verse eid="EZR 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2" />Wayahudi wawakwela iwapinga wa chigheni, na pfipfila wawakwelela wasongolo wawo. Apfo iwanu iwelile wa Imulungu wehanganya na iwanu wa isi tsingi, na pfilongotsi na iwakulu wawo iwanduse ukutenda agho ighehile.” <verse eid="EZR 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3" />Baho hanihulike agho, nidegha ghamabwende ghangu na likanzu lyangu, nitsing'ola mvili tsangu, na ndepfu tsangu kwa usungu mkulu, na nikala hasi aku nikangawala ghendo. <verse eid="EZR 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4" />Baho iwanu wose wang'ali woghademekela ghamalonga gha Imulungu kwa aghala ghehile gha watendile iwanu iwoyile kulawa kuna isi ya mhamo, hawanduse kwitingana habehi na nene aku ning'ali nikangawala mbaka nemihe, chipindi cha ukulapfa nambiko. <verse eid="EZR 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5" />Nemihe, ichipindi cha ukulapfa nambiko hachipfikile, nyinuka kwa usungu mkulu ahala hanikalile aku mabwende ghangu na kanzu lyangu ghadegheka, apfo nitowa ghamapfindi na kumgholosela ghamoko IMNDEWA, Imulungu wangu na kumlomba, <verse eid="EZR 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6" />nilonga, “Ghwe Imulungu wangu, nakona chinyala kwinula uhanga wangu hambele hako. Nzambi tsetu tsiwa lundo kulu kubita chimo cha ghamatwi ghetu, na matotso ghetu ghopfika kulanga. <verse eid="EZR 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7" />Kulawa ghamatsuwa gha iwahenda wetu mbaka sambi twetwe tukutotsela sideke. Na kwa tsinzambi tsetu, twetwe, wafalume wetu na iwatambika wetu tutawalighwa, tukomighwa, tughoghighwa na tubokighwa mali tsetu na wafalume wa isi tsingi. Na mbaka leloli aino tughelighwa chinyala chikulu ghendo. <verse eid="EZR 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8" />Lekeni sambi, ghwe IMNDEWA Imulungu wetu, kwa chipindi chidodo, kututendela uluso mkulu na kutuleka wamwenga wetu tuswekuke kulawa kuna utumwa, na twokala wagima hanu ahano haenzeluke. Apfo Imulungu wetu katsipfughula tsinenge tsetu tsone keli na katutenda twone ng'apfu mna utumwa wetu. <verse eid="EZR 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9" />Kwaapfila twetwe twawatumwa, lekeni Imulungu wetu ng'utulekile baye kuna utumwa. Kuwatenda wafalume wa Uajemi watutendele uluso, na kutuleka tuwe wagima, na kuitsenga ing'anda yako ikalile ibomoka, naghwe kututsengela ubanda wa kutukinga mna isi ya Yuda na ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10" />Lekeni sambi tulonge choni, ghwe Imulungu wetu, kwa agho ghose ighalawile? Mana hamwe na ghose ghaututendele twetwe tuleka keli kukinda ghamalaghitso ghako, <verse eid="EZR 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11" />ghautwing'ile kubitila watumighwa wako manabii, haulongile ‘Isi yamuighendela kuisola iwe yenu, isi ayo iha, na ikodotsolighwa na iwanu iwokala amwo, isi imema ukwiha kwawo kulawa membe imwe mbaka mbembe ingi. <verse eid="EZR 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12" />Apfo mleke kuwaleka neghe tsenu wakwelighwe na iwana wawo, wala mleke kuwaleka iwana wenu wawakwele neghe tsawo. Mleke kuwaleka wakale tseghamba wala wabwede, apfo mtsokala na ngupfu na kuja pfinu pfinoghile pfa isi ayo, na isi ayo mtsowalekela iwana wenu iwe yawo matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="EZR 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13" />Ghose ighatupatile ghatupata kwaapfila tsatutenda ghehile na tsatutotsa sideke. Lekeni ghwe Imulungu wetu kutuhigha chidogho hata ka tsinzambi tsatutendile tsanyingi ng'ani, naghwe kuteka wamwenga wetu tuwe wagima ka pfatuli leloli. <verse eid="EZR 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14" />Apfi tutsakuyila keli kuleka ukughakinda ghamalaghitso ghako na kwikwela na iwanu awano iwotenda ghehile? Angu ng'utsotughudubukila baye, na kutukoma ghendo, na yaleke koneka hata yumwe wetu iyali mgima wala wowose iyodaha ukuswekuka? <verse eid="EZR 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, ghweghwe kuna haki na kutuleka tukale ka pfatuli leloli aino. Twa mna ghamatotso ghetu hambele hako, aku twomanya ka kuduhu wowose yana ihaki ya ukwima hambele hako.’ ”<verse eid="EZR 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10" />
  <para style="s">Ukwikwela na wanu wa isi tsingi komala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1" />Ezra hayang'ali yolomba na kutoghola ka katenda nzambi tsake aku kolila na keghwisa hasi hambele ha ing'anda ya Imulungu, Waisiraeli wengi, wamale na mapinga na iwana tsawetingana habehi naye na walila kwa usungu mkulu. <verse eid="EZR 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2" />Baho Shekania imwana wa Yehieli wa lukolo lwa Elamu kamlongela Ezra, “Ng'atumuhulikitse Imulungu baye kwa kukwela iwapinga wa chigheni wa isi atsino, lekeni hata apfo hana lolelo kwa iwanu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="EZR 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3" />Apfo twike laghano na Imulungu wetu, tuwaleke wapinga awano, na iwana wawo kwa kuwinza aghala ghaulongile ghweghwe, na aghala ghawalongile wanu wangi iwokinda kwa kughudema ghamalaghitso gha Imulungu. Ghose ghatendeke ka ghamalaghitso pfagholonga. <verse eid="EZR 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4" />Lelo winuke, kwaapfila imbuli aino yamna ghamoko ghako, twetwe tutsakuwa hamwe naghwe. Wighume ghumoyo na utende apfo.” <verse eid="EZR 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5" />Ezra kandusa ukuwatenda iwatambika, pfilongotsi, Walawi, na Waisiraeli wose welahe ka watsotenda ka pfailongighwe, nawo watoghola ukwilaha. <verse eid="EZR 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6" />Kuya Ezra koka hambele ha ing'anda ya Imulungu, kaghenda ukaye kwa Yehohanani mwana wa Eliashibu. Ezra kakala ako chilo chighima bila kuja wala ukunwa chinu chochose kwaapfila yang'ali yolila kwa litotso alila lya iwanu iwoyile kulawa kuna isi ya mhamo <verse eid="EZR 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7" />Usenga utumighwa chila hanu kuna isi ya Yuda na kuna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu ka iwanu wose iwalawile kuna isi ya mhamo wetingane Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:8" />Usenga awo ulonga ka munu wowose ng'apfikile mna chipindi cha matsuwa madatu ka pfilongotsi pfawalongile, tsimali tsake tsose tsitsosolighwa, naye katsoghomighwa kwilunga na iwanu iwoyile kulawa kuna isi ya mhamo. <verse eid="EZR 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9" />Mna ghamatsuwa agho madatu, iwanu wose iwakalile mna isi ya Yuda na Benjamini wapfika Yerusalemu na wetingana hana ichibwalu cha ing'anda ya Imulungu, mna litsuwa lya ishirini lya ghumwetsi ghwa tisa. Iwanu wose wang'ali woghudema kwa imbuli yawakemelighwe, na imvula nyingi ing'ali itowa. <verse eid="EZR 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10" />Bho imtambika Ezra kema kawalongela, “Mtotsa kwa kukwela iwapinga wa isi tsingi, apfo myongetsela isi ya Isiraeli ghamatotso. <verse eid="EZR 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11" />Lelo muungame hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa aba tsenu, na mtende aghala ighomnoghela. Mwibaghule na iwanu iwokala mna isi aino, na muwaleke wapinga wenu wa isi tsingi.” <verse eid="EZR 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12" />Iwanu wose wedika wadamilila walonga, “Ona! Twotenda ka pfaulonga.” <verse eid="EZR 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13" />Pfipfila walonga keli, “Iwanu twawengi ahano, na imvula yotowa sideke. Ng'atudaha baye kughendelela ukwima ahano mchibwalu, mana isang'ano aino ng'aimalitsika kwa litsuwa limwe au matsuwa meli! Kwaapfila tutenda nzambi ng'ulu mna imbuli aino. <verse eid="EZR 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14" />Ng'apfu pfilongotsi wetu wasighale Yerusalemu wailole imbuli aino yawabamile kulola iwanu wose. Kuya chila yumwe yakwelile ipinga wa kulawa isi ingi yatse kwa nzamu yake, na pfilongotsi na walamlitsi wa ghumji ghwake mbaka imaya ng'ulu ya Imulungu haitsoleghusighwa kuna twetwe.” <verse eid="EZR 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15" />Wose tsawatoghola imbuli aino, ila Yonasani imwana wa Asaheli na Yazeya imwana wa Tikwa wawo ng'awaitoghole baye, na Meshulamu na mlawi Shabatai tsawahamwe nawo. <verse eid="EZR 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16" />Iwanu wose iwoyile kulawa isi ya mhamo waitoghola imbuli aino. Apfo mtambika Ezra kawasaghula iwamale kulawa kuna pfilongotsi wa tsikolo na kawandika ghamataghwa ghawo. Halipfikile litsuwa lya kadatu lya ghumwetsi ghwa kumi, iwanu awo wandusa ukulola ghoya imbuli aino. <verse eid="EZR 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17" />Mna litsuwa lya mwanduso lya ghumwetsi ghwa mwanduso wamalitsa imbuli ya iwamale wose iwakwelile wapinga wa chigheni.<verse eid="EZR 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwamale iwakwelile wapinga wa isi tsingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18" />Awano wawo iwatambika iwakwelile wapinga wa isi tsingi kwa ukulola tsikolo tsao, Lukolo lwa Yoshua, imwana wa Yosadaki na ndughu tsake: Maaseya, Eliezeri, Jaribu na Gedalia. <verse eid="EZR 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19" />Awano tsawalonga wowaleka wapinga wawo na chila yumwe kolapfa ng'unzu yawe nambiko kwa ajili ya litotso lyake. <verse eid="EZR 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20" />Iwanu wa lukolo lwa Imeri tsa Hanani na Zebadia: <verse eid="EZR 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21" />Wanu wa lukolo lwa Harimu tsa Maaseya, Eliya, Shemaya Yehieli na Uzia. <verse eid="EZR 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22" />Wanu wa lukolo lwa Pashuri tsa Eliehoenai, Maaseya, Ishimaeli, Netaneli, Yozabadi. <verse eid="EZR 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23" />Walawi tsawakala Yozabadi, Shimei, Kelaya, pfipfila iyamanyike ka Kelita, Petahia, Yuda na Eliezeri. <verse eid="EZR 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24" />Na iwakwimba tsa Eliashibu, na iwokalitsa ing'anda ye Imulungu tsa Shalumu, Telemu na Uri. <verse eid="EZR 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25" />Na iwanu wangi wa Isiraeli kulawa lukolo lwa Paroshi tsa Ramiya, Izia, Malikiya, Miyamini, Eleazeri, Malikiya na Benaya. <verse eid="EZR 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26" />Wanu wa lukolo lwa Elamu tsa Metaniya, Zekaria, Yehieli, Abidi, Yeremoti na Eliya. <verse eid="EZR 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27" />Wanu wa lukolo lwa Zatu tsa Eliehoenai, Eliashibu, Matania, Yeremoti, Zabadi na Aziza. <verse eid="EZR 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28" />Wanu wa lukolo lwa Bebai tsa Yehohanani, Hananiya, Zabai na Atilai. <verse eid="EZR 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29" />Wanu wa lukolo lwa Bani tsa Meshulamu, Maluki, Adaya, Yashubu, Sheali na Yeremoti. <verse eid="EZR 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30" />Wanu wa lukolo lwa Pahati Moabu tsa Adina, Keleli, Benaya, Maaseya, Matania, Besaleli, Binui na Manase. <verse eid="EZR 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31" />Wanu wa lukolo lwa Harimu tsa Eliezeri, Ishiya, Malikiya, Shemaya, Shimeoni, <verse eid="EZR 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:32" />na Benjamini, Maluki na Shemaria. <verse eid="EZR 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33" />Wanu wa lukolo lwa Hashumu tsa Matenai, Matata, Zabadi, Elifeleti, Yeremai, Manese na Shimei. <verse eid="EZR 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34" />Wanu wa lukolo lwa Bani tsa Maadai, Amramu, Ueli, <verse eid="EZR 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 10:35" />Benaya, Bedaya, Keluhi, <verse eid="EZR 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 10:36" />Wania, Meremoti, Eliashibu <verse eid="EZR 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:37" />Mataniya, Matenai na Yaasu. <verse eid="EZR 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38" />wanu wa lukolo lwa Binui tsa iwo awano: Shimei, <verse eid="EZR 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 10:39" />Shelemiya, Natani, Adaya, <verse eid="EZR 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 10:40" />Maknadebai, Shashai, Sharai, <verse eid="EZR 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 10:41" />Azareli, Shelemiya na Shemaria, <verse eid="EZR 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:42" />Shalumu, Amaria, na Yosefu. <verse eid="EZR 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43" />Wanu wa lukolo lwa Nebo tsa Yeieli, Matitiya, Zabadi, Zebina, Yadai, Yoeli na Benaya. <verse eid="EZR 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44" />Iwamale wose awano tsawawakwela wapinga wa chigheni, na wamwenga wawo tsawawelekela wana. Apfo wawaleka wapinga wawo hamwe na iwana wawo.<verse eid="EZR 10:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10" />
</usx>